  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/en/offerings/vacancies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Defence Research &amp; Development Organisation (DRDO CEPTAM)</a> </span>has released the Tier-II Admit Card for the recruitment of Senior Technical Assistant-B, Technician-A Posts on the official website. This recruitment was released for 764 posts. Applications for the DRDO CEPTAM-11 Recruitment 2026 were accepted from December 11, 2025, to January 11, 2026. The Tier-II&nbsp; examination is going to conducted on 15 June 2026. Candidates who had appeared in Tier-I Examination can download their DRDO CEPTAM-11 Tier-II Admit Card 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">DRDO-Recruitment &amp; Assessment Centre (RAC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">DRDO CEPTAM-11 Tier-II Admit Card 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Application Start Date : <strong>11 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Last Date : <strong>11 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>13 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Form Correction Date : <strong>14-16 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date : <strong>23 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam City Details : <strong>13 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card : <strong>20 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key : <strong>25 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Tier-I Result : <strong>25 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Tier-II Exam Date : <strong>15 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Tier-II Exam Date : <strong>12 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Gen / OBC / EWS / MSP : <strong>Rs. 750/-</strong> (<strong>For STA Post</strong>)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Gen / OBC / EWS / MSP : <strong>Rs. 600/-</strong> (<strong>For Tech. A Post</strong>)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST / PH / ESM / All Female : <strong>Rs.</strong><strong>&nbsp;500/-</strong> (<strong>For Both Posts</strong>)</span><br>\n<span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Fees Refund (After Tier-I Exam)</strong> </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC / EWS / MSP : <strong>Rs.</strong><strong>&nbsp;500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST / PH / All Female : <strong>Rs.</strong><strong>&