\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In order to download their DRDO CEPTAM-11 Tier-II Admit Card candidates need to go to the important link section provided below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After getting the link candidates need to click it for downloading their DRDO CEPTAM-11 Tier-II Admit Card.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates will be redirected to Login Page, Here they have to provide their following details-:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Registration No. /Login ID/Roll No.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Password/DOB</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Verification Code(if specified)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After providing their details appropriately candidates will be able to download their DRDO CEPTAM-11 Tier-II Admit Card.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates can also download their Tier-II Admit Card from official site of the DRDO.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>DRDO CEPTAM-11 Recruitment 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Shortlisting Based on GATE Score</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Personal Interview</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div cla